WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.234
Welcome to Building Defender XDR,

2
00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:06.212
a developer workbook in the
Federal Modernization Workbook.

3
00:00:06.212 --> 00:00:09.288
This is Chapter 3:
prevention through audit.

4
00:00:09.288 --> 00:00:13.634
A setting in a policy protects
nothing until the device enforces it,

5
00:00:13.634 --> 00:00:18.137
so the check is on the device, against
the stage the ring is meant to be at.

6
00:00:18.137 --> 00:00:22.760
We'll start from Learn's three device
commands and the guide's event query,

7
00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:26.459
read how the kit compares every
device with its ring's plan,

8
00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:29.387
and walk two labs, the
evidence and the dangers.

9
00:00:29.387 --> 00:00:32.255
The chapter has been
reviewed and approved;

10
00:00:32.255 --> 00:00:35.660
the code is illustrative,
tested against fixtures.
